# 2. DEVELOPMENT OBJECTIVE

Build a complete enterprise-grade HRMS that supports a manufacturing organization with multiple branches, departments, plants, offices, employees, managers and HR administrators.

The HRMS must support the complete employee lifecycle:

Employee creation → Onboarding → Organization assignment → Attendance → Shift allocation → Leave → Performance → Payroll → Payslip → Employee Self-Service → Separation.

All modules must be interconnected through consistent employee records, organization references, APIs and database relationships.

Avoid creating disconnected screens or isolated demo modules.

Every feature must have its own appropriate backend logic, database design and permission controls.

